  "description": "Modulable is a powerful, flexible, and extensible library that allows developers to integrate modular components into their .NET applications. It provides an easy-to-use interface for creating and managing modules that execute specific tasks within an application, enabling clean separation of concerns and high reusability.\n\nThe Module package allows developers to create modules that can be subscribed to events, execute specific actions, and interact with other modules. It also provides a way to manage tasks dynamically, with functionality to add, remove, and trigger modules at runtime.",
